'' A 'const as ustring' FOR AN ENTRY POINT THAT TAKES AN FBUSTRING DESCRIPTOR: 'write',
'' 'print using', and a 'wstring * N' destination (fb_UStrAssignToW). UStrOutOperand_
'' asked the constant for an address, got none, and each statement was dropped: TKO0994.
'' The constant is now copied like an rvalue, into a ustring temporary initialised from
'' its text (src/mir/lowerstrargs.tiko). fbc-modern 1.20 has no 'const as ustring'
'' (error 24), so there is no differential.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/const-ustring-out.bas -o tests/driver/constustrout.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/constustrout.exe
'' RUN: tests/driver/constustrout.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: hi 2-1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ns
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: nshi
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: "hi",1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: "ns"
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [hi]
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: hi ns
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
